  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Namport&#xbf;s Digital and Green Transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objectives (Outcomes) of this contract are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Description&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;The proposed support include studies that will enable NamPort on its &lt;/span&gt;Digital and Green Transition&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt; namely on :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xbf; Supporting &lt;strong&gt;smart, clean &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;secure &lt;/strong&gt;investments in quality infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xbf; A model of &lt;strong&gt;trusted connectivity &lt;/strong&gt;with partner countries that is long-term and values driven&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xbf; Offering not only solid financial conditions, but also promoting the &lt;strong&gt;highest environmental and social standards &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xbf; An &lt;strong&gt;ethical approach &lt;/strong&gt;so that infrastructure projects do not create unsustainable debt&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
